import MettapediaFourColor.NearLinearDiamondData

/-!
# Pinned oriented discharging rules

The 84 oriented rules are the complete rule set at revision
`d85bfe09e9584d675fdf33a1da61067575ec4883` of
https://github.com/near-linear-4ct/discharging-rules.
The unmodified files, hashes and MIT notice (copyright 2026 Yuta Inoue)
are retained in tools/fourcolor/near-linear.

Rows retain all degree bounds and cyclic entries. The boundary gap -1
becomes 0; the separate upper-degree field uses 0 for infinity. Vertices
are one-based in rows and zero-based in the typed interface. This module
checks the complete data and short paths, not a cartwheel classification.
-/

